testdata/err/250_interface_method_missing.aic:5:14: error: `implements` is retired: an interface is satisfied structurally by the method signature set
    implements
    fix: drop the implements clause: a class that matches the interface signatures satisfies it automatically
testdata/err/250_interface_method_missing.aic:6:5: error: a top-level var declaration is not allowed (red line 21)
    a top-level var
    fix: mutable global state means: create objects inside main and pass them as arguments; for constants write const
